# The census fixture is committed as C SOURCE, never as a binary: a checked-in
# PE is a fixture nobody can audit, and it would drift silently from the .c it
# claims to be built from. Rebuild it with the one command in README.md:
#
#   x86_64-w64-mingw32-gcc -O1 -o legacy_app.exe legacy_app.c \
#       -lgdi32 -luser32 -ladvapi32
legacy_app.exe
